minnow

The LLaDA2.2 model execution and joint diffusion decoding logic are adapted into
Rust from inclusionAI/LLaDA2.2-mini's Apache-2.0 reference implementation:
https://huggingface.co/inclusionAI/LLaDA2.2-mini

Reference copyright notice:
Copyright 2025 Antgroup and The HuggingFace Inc. team. All rights reserved.

minnow changes the implementation language, checkpoint loading, expert execution,
attention/KV caching, and serving interface. The trained checkpoint is separate
and is not distributed in this repository. The bundled small test checkpoint
contains deterministic random weights generated for validation.
